This is a (probably incomplete) list of things (mainly config options)
that do not work with CHERI for some reason.
- UAPI header compile test and our compat headers
- Check open tickets from morello that never got resolved
  https://git.morello-project.org/morello/kernel/linux/-/issues
- Move argv, envp and aux vector data off the program stack.
  We already pass capabilities in registers but the data itself
  should not be accessible by the stack capability.
- Port PROT_CAP/PROT_NO_CAP for mmap and friends from CheriBSD
- ptrace(): Deal with capability writes
- CONFIG_ERRATA_SIFIVE_CIP_453
- CONFIG_RISCV_ISA_SUPM
- SHADOW_CALL_STACK
- RANDSTRUCT
- SELF TESTS
- FORTIFY_SOURCE
- TOMOYO
- LOCKDEP
- runtime-const.h
- semaphore debugging
- Implement set_bit/clear_bit for pointers
- KCOV
- UBSAN
- KFENCE
- CONFIG_NUMA
- Sanitizers
- CONFIG_CFI
- KEXEC
- CONFIG_KVM, VIRTUALIZATION
- BPF
- GCOV
- PERF_EVENTS
- TRACE (in progress)
- USERFAULTFD
- STACK_AUTO_INIT, CONFIG_INIT_STACK_...
- CONFIG_ZRAM
- NTFS3	=> Has a static assertion in log replay
- NILFS2	=> Uses a bmap tree with fixed __u64 value that must store a pointer
- OCFS2	=> The ioctl API uses nested pointers
- F2FS	=> Strange bit operation magic on page_private() pointer.
- DCACHE_WORD_ACCESS	=> Disabled for CHERI, try to enable it!
- BTREE	=> Doable but only used by 3 drivers and uses arrays of longs to store pointers.
- CRYPTO_842	=> Compress has a failing assertion
- CONFIG_ACPI	=> In memory tables need some more thought.
- CONFIG_EFI	=> API needs much more thought.
- NOUVEAU		=> Various complicated UAPI issues
- CONFIG_RDS
- CONFIG_CUSE	=> ioctls have UAPI issues.
- CONFIG_RISCV_MODULE_LINKING_KUNIT
- CONFIG_DVB_VIDTV
- CONFIG_VIDEO_MEDIATEK_MDP
- CONFIG_VIDEO_MEDIATEK_VCODEC
- CONFIG_VIDEO_MEDIATEK_MDP3
- CONFIG_SCSI_BFA_FC
- CONFIG_MEGARAID_{MM,SAS,MAILBOX,LEGACY}
- CONFIG_SCSI_SNIC
- CONFIG_SCSI_HPTIOP
- CONFIG_SCSI_CHELSIO_FCOE
- CONFIG_SCSI_AACRAID
- CONFIG_THUNDER_NIC_VF
- CONFIG_MVPP2
- CONFIG_BE2NET
- CONFIG_INFINIBAND_OCRDMA
- CONFIG_SH_ETH
- CONFIG_BNXT
- CONFIG_NETXEN_NIC
- CONFIG_XILINX_LL_TEMAC
- CONFIG_QED
- CONFIG_ROCKER
- CONFIG_NI_XGE_MANAGEMENT_ENET
- CONFIG_VME_FAKE
- CONFIG_INFINIBAND
- CONFIG_ALTERA_STAPL
- CONFIG_QCOM_FASTRPC
- CONFIG_GENWQE
- CONFIG_FUSION
- CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_QAT_*
- CONFIG_CRYPTO_DEV_CHELSIO
- CONFIG_ATM_FORE200E
- CONFIG_ATM_ENI
- VHOST and dependant config options
- CONFIG_TCM_USER2
- CONFIG_ARCNET_COM90xx
- CONFIG_USB_CONFIGFS_F_UAC*
- CONFIG_BCM2835_VCHIQ
- CONFIG_DLM with COMPAT64
- CONFIG_FBNIC
